# >>> MOCHAARCH GITHUB SAFETY IGNORE >>>
# Segredos e chaves
.ssh/
**/.ssh/
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.*
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ed25519.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Tokens/senhas por nome de arquivo
**/*token*
**/*secret*
**/*senha*
**/*password*

# Quarentena, backups locais e cópias operacionais
_QUARENTENA/
quarentena/
**/_QUARENTENA/
**/quarentena/
**/backups/
**/*.bak
**/*.old
**/*.orig
**/*.tmp

# Máquinas virtuais, ISOs e imagens brutas
**/*.qcow2
**/*.vdi
**/*.vmdk
**/*.raw
**/*.iso
**/*.img
**/*.ova
**/*.ovf

# Caches e builds locais
**/.cache/
**/cache/
**/Cache/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/pkg/
**/src/
**/pacman-cache/
**/var-cache-pacman/

# Lixo local
.Trash-*/
**/.Trash-*/
**/*~
# <<< MOCHAARCH GITHUB SAFETY IGNORE <<<

